==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{term|frosk|lang=enm}}, from {{etyl|non|en}} {{term|froskr||frog|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|en}} {{m|gem-pro|*fruskaz}}, {{m|gem-pro|*fruþskaz||frog}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|en}} {{m|ine-pro|*prew-||to jump, hop}}. Cognate with {{etyl|ang|-}} {{term|frox|lang=ang}}, {{term|frosc||frog|lang=ang}}. More at {{l|en|frosh}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|dialectal|lang=en}} A [[frog]].

